+  //
+  // For movk, an explicit shift can be used to indicate which half word should
+  // be overwritten, eg. movk(x0, 0, 0) will overwrite the least-significant
+  // half word with zero, whereas movk(x0, 0, 48) will overwrite the
+  // most-significant.
